'''Purify'''{{Unofficial}} is a water-type [[Spells|spell]] that purifies water.

==Description==
Purify is a spell that consists of a central water sigil enclosed by two [[Signs Explained#Refuse|refuse signs]] on either side, and surrounded by [[Signs Explained#Purify|purify signs]] above and below. The seal purifies wastewater. {{Ref|m|61|99}}

==Usage==
[[Coco]] debuts this spell at the [[Silver Eve]] festival during the [[Silver Eve Procession]] drawn on the [[Portable Waste Purification Pot]]. [[Coco]] pours wastewater into the large pot and showcases how the pot purifies and cleans the water thanks to the seal to the crowd. {{Ref|m|61|98}}

